  "description": "Test your mettle on the large-wheeled Double Peak 29\" Comp. You'll be ripping it up with a lightweight, high performance component package: 2x10-speed Shimano Deore drivetrain, FSA crankset, light Kenda Honey Badger XC tires and WTB components.\nNew Haro Double Peak 29\" 6000 Series alloy frame\nNew 16, 18, 20 & 22-inch sizes\nSuntour XCM 100mm travel fork w/ hydraulic lockout\nNew FSA Comet Modular MegaExo 38/24t crankset, M10 chainrings\nShimano Deore M618 front derailleur\nShimano Deore rear derailleur\nShimano CS-HG50-10 10-speed 11-36T cassette\nShimano Deore SL-M610 shifters\nWTB Werewolf grips and Rocket Sport saddle\nKenda Honey Badger XC 27.5*2.05 tires\nWeinmann XC-180 Disc alloy double wall rims\nNew MY17 Shimano M315 hydraulic disc brakeset",
